WEBVTT

00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:03.460
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:06.440
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:23.250
Where am I?

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:42.380
Hi, signalize!

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:47.740
The answer lies on the other side of the sky

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:47.740
kotae wa motto takai sora no kanata

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.630
No, that's wrong

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.630
iie chigau yo

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:55.010
I can see with my eyes that it's at the end of the Earth

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:55.010
boku no me ni mo mieta chi no hate

00:00:55.390 --> 00:00:56.800
Do that signalize!

00:00:56.930 --> 00:01:01.980
Something's starting to bubble up

00:00:56.930 --> 00:01:01.980
hageshiku natta mune no atsui powaa

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:05.940
From the burning power in my raging heart

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:05.940
sou da minagiru nanika ga

00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:09.480
So I'll believe in the present

00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:09.480
dakara ima wo shinjite

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:14.650
And start today since it's more than a faint desire

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:14.650
hajimeyou tada no akogare ja nai

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:15.990
Chance for me

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:21.290
Dreams can make even the harshest nightmare pleasant

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:21.290
zankoku na yume ga yume de yume ni narunda

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:25.500
It's just another challenge on the way

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:25.500
hora chousen matteru yo

00:01:26.210 --> 00:01:30.420
Where are we headed?

00:01:26.210 --> 00:01:30.420
kimi to mukau basho wa doko darou

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:34.170
Into a brilliant hope

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:34.170
mabushii kibou no naka e

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:41.430
Where do we want to go? Let's go find it right now

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:41.430
nozomu basho wa doko darou sagashi ni ikou yo shuppatsu da

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:44.810
Where we're headed

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:44.810
mukau basho wa mirai no

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:48.690
is into our hopes for the future

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:48.690
bokura no kibou no naka ni

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:56.030
Our destination is the future, the light is our signal Let's go, go!

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:56.030
nozomu basho wa mirai no kagayaki ga aizu let's go, go

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:04.020
Rejoice, honeys!

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:08.810
Your long-awaited Special Audition is fast approaching!

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:09.960
Okay!

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:11.190
You're sure excited.

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:15.080
Special Auditions are basically final exams for us, you know.

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:16.810
But it's an audition!

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:19.240
I can't help but get excited for it.

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:20.660
Starmiya.

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:22.410
I like your enthusiasm.

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:23.660
Thanks!

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:27.080
If you pass this audition, you'll receive a Mastery of Appearance.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.830
Everyhoney, do your best.

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:29.750
Yes!

00:02:30.430 --> 00:02:34.920
Get it? The outcome of this Special 
Audition hinges on good team play.

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.540
We're all in this together.

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:37.350
Aye!

00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:39.970
We got permission to have a special private dance lesson.

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:41.430
Yay!

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:45.430
Sharpen your movements. Be aware of your entire body, go.

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:49.440
Keep your sexy side down; focus on your hamstrings.

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:51.110
Hamstrongs?

00:02:51.110 --> 00:02:54.940
It's <i>hamstrings</i>. They're the muscles on the back of your thighs.

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:57.940
It originally referred to the tendons behind your quads.

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:00.450
Stop right there! I can't stand to watch any longer.

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:02.880
I'd rather watch zombies dance around a fire.

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:05.950
You don't understand the essence of "Appearance" at all.

00:03:06.550 --> 00:03:07.740
Appearance?

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:09.140
It's how you look.

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:11.870
Appearance isn't <i>just</i> how you look.

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:13.460
There's more to it?

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:18.230
I can't give you the answer <i>that</i> easily... What do you think your head is for?

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:20.470
Think about it by yourselves.

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:24.800
With that out of the way, time for the deluxe daily special!

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:27.000
What do you mean, "out of the way"?

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:29.870
Wouldn't a daily <i>detox</i> be better than a deluxe for you?

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:34.200
"Appearance isn't just how you look." 
In other words, you need stamina too.

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:35.440
I don't know about that.

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:40.360
Don't worry about it. Aoi's keeping track of the calories for me.

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:45.950
Candied tofu is delicious.

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:47.450
Just desserts?

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:52.710
Otome is 50% sweets. The other half is made of Love You.

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:57.130
That's right. For example, chocolate is high in calories and fat,

00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:02.590
but it has antioxidants, increases your concentration ability, and is overflowing with fiber and minerals.

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:07.350
They say that even people stranded on snowy mountains can survive on chocolate until being rescued.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:08.510
I see.

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:11.480
Since all four of us are here, let's get down to business.

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:13.750
So for this Special Audition...

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:15.480
Otome-chan's gone...

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:17.480
Where did she go?

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:18.980
Love you.

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:22.710
Otome adores beautiful and cute things all the same.

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:26.240
We have something to talk about.

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:28.740
Here she is, Coach Ran.

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:29.910
Good.

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:33.500
Listen. Like I said before, we need good team play.

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:38.470
That's why we think that you should have Premium cards for the audition.

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:40.000
Premium cards?

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.490
You've seen all our battle clothes, right?

00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:44.130
I use Spicy Ageha.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:45.650
Angely Sugar.

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:49.390
Futuring Girl. You use Happy Rainbow, don't you?

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:52.140
Happy Rainbow, Love You.

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:57.730
Each brand's top designer puts their heart and soul into creating their best outfit, the Premium Coord.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:01.340
In order to complete one, you need to have a full set of Premium Rare cards.

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:03.190
They're called Premium Cards for short.

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:04.900
That's hardly shorter.

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:11.200
That's why you'll need to go straight to Happy Rainbow's top designer to ask for Premium Cards.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:13.910
You also need to prove your determination to get them.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:20.190
Okay, got it. Happy Rainbow is Love You!

00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:22.420
I'm gonna get Premium Cards!

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:27.180
So, where can I find the top designer of Happy Rainbow?

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:30.680
Oh my God!

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:33.060
A difficult problem.

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:38.260
Makoto-san, the top designer of Happy Rainbow, is famous for being hard to please.

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:40.060
It won't go so easily.

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:42.190
Is that so?

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:45.950
Don't worry, I'm as reliable as the Titanic.

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:48.450
Isn't he just going to ask the Headmistress again?

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:56.360
He said all that, but the Special Audition is already tomorrow.

00:05:56.360 --> 00:05:58.140
That Johnny-sensei.

00:05:58.140 --> 00:06:00.960
Won't I be able to get Premium Cards?

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:04.460
If it comes to that, then none of us will use Premium Cards.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:06.030
We wouldn't be a team otherwise.

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:09.150
Otome doesn't want to hold everyone back.

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:12.950
That's not it, it's just better for us to match. It isn't your fault.

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:14.890
That's right, it's nothing to worry about.

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:16.990
Otome can't pass as she is now.

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:18.840
That's too harsh, Ran.

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:20.140
Yeah, you're out of line.

00:06:20.140 --> 00:06:21.480
Just listen.

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:26.960
"I can't pass without Premium Cards. I'll just hold back everyone else without them."

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:29.780
Isn't that what you're thinking, Otome?

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:35.240
Right? Even if we don't use Premium Cards, we'll just overcome it with our own abilities.

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:36.020
Ran!

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:36.930
That was so cool!

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:38.370
That wasn't my intention.

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.750
I understand. I'll do my best.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:43.240
Time for special training!

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:45.500
Aikatsu!

00:06:46.180 --> 00:06:47.510
Next are stretches. {if you're seeing this, we have no idea what she's saying}

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:50.880
Rotate your hip, and strengthen your inner muscles.

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:54.910
Otome gives up!

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:56.720
Yeah, let's take a break.

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:59.140
You really can't take stretching lightly.

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:00.980
But it's fun to work up a sweat.

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:05.980
Wonder who it is?

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:07.960
Oh, it's Moon-san.

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:11.590
"The moon shines solitary in the night sky,

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:14.120
beautiful because you cannot reach it."

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:17.450
I don't really get it, but it sure sounds nice.

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:25.750
Sensei! Sensei!

00:07:24.140 --> 00:07:25.750
Sorry!

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.990
I've already apologized!

00:07:27.990 --> 00:07:29.310
Oh well.

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:33.940
I can't believe Johnny-sensei ended up not being able to contact Makoto-san.

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:36.180
Even though the Special Audition is today...

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:38.980
None of us will use Premium Cards.

00:07:38.980 --> 00:07:42.270
In exchange, let's show them the best performance ever.

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:44.020
Right!

00:07:44.470 --> 00:07:45.480
Arisugawa.

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:50.450
I heard back from Makoto-san, the top designer of Happy Rainbow.

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:52.410
He said that he could see you at four today.

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:55.370
He's really strict about being on time, so make sure not to be late.

00:07:55.690 --> 00:07:58.810
But that's right before the audition time!

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:01.130
It's up to you, Arisugawa.

00:08:01.130 --> 00:08:04.180
Will you get the Premium Cards, or give up on them?

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:05.000
Right.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:07.130
You might not make it back in time.

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:09.200
But clothes make the girl.

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:12.490
Clothes give confidence and brilliance to whoever wears them.

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:14.920
That's the power of fashion.

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:16.720
Otome-chan, what'll you do?

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:20.140
Aye! I'm gonna go meet Makoto-san.

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:26.150
Is it around here?

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:29.020
I'm completely lost.

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:39.240
What a cute old lady!

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:41.250
Love you!

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:45.170
What are you thinking calling someone an old lady and then grabbing them like this?

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:47.250
How disrespectful of you.

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:49.470
Oh my! I'm very sorry.

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:50.970
Wait right there.

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:52.100
Yes?

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:56.930
If you're going to call somebody old,
 then be prepared to do them a favor.

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:58.760
What do you mean?

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:02.300
I lived in this town a long time ago.

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:04.640
I'm searching for a large camphor tree.

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:06.650
A big camphor tree?

00:09:10.630 --> 00:09:11.910
I don't see it.

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:15.590
If I could find it that easily then I wouldn't have to rely on someone like you.

00:09:15.590 --> 00:09:17.910
But why are you looking for it?

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:20.910
It's a place with fond memories of my first love.

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:23.050
First love?! Hatsukoi?!

00:09:23.050 --> 00:09:24.590
What wonderful words!

00:09:24.590 --> 00:09:27.110
Makoto is strict about being on time.

00:09:30.280 --> 00:09:33.310
Both Premium Cards and Love are important to me!

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:36.300
Love You Power!

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:39.460
Please allow me to assist you! Um...

00:09:39.460 --> 00:09:41.330
I'm Ikuyo.

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:45.060
Ikuyo-san, I'll definitely help find that camphor tree!

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:57.240
I wonder how Otome-chan's doing?

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:58.990
Should you really be worrying about others?

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:03.240
We've yet to fully understand the meaning of Appearance like our instructor told us to think about.

00:10:03.920 --> 00:10:07.350
It's not as simple as runway walking or dancing.

00:10:07.350 --> 00:10:09.580
It's not just makeup either...

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:13.290
It's a text from Otome-chan.

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:14.730
She needs our help!

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:15.880
Let's go!

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:18.300
Hey, what about the Special Audition?

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:21.800
We got permission to leave campus and sped over here...

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:23.600
But you're just looking for a camphor tree?

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:27.240
You understand that today's really important, right?

00:10:27.240 --> 00:10:30.600
Yes! But this is about Ikuyo-san's memories of her first love.

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:33.110
So please help me search with her.

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:35.380
Okay, let's go together.

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:38.470
Let's finish this quickly so we can meet with Makoto-san.

00:10:38.470 --> 00:10:43.120
I can't tell anything from the map. Do you have any clues about where it might be?

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:45.620
I think it was close by a shrine.

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:48.620
Then that makes it easy. "Shrine"...

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:51.060
There are so many!

00:10:51.060 --> 00:10:53.130
We don't have time to go to them all.

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:54.630
We've got no choice!

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:57.960
I'm not as young as you girls.

00:10:57.960 --> 00:10:59.630
I can't walk that far.

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:03.610
Alright! Then I'll give you a lift.

00:11:03.610 --> 00:11:05.390
You will? Thank you.

00:11:07.530 --> 00:11:09.390
Ai... katsu!

00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:10.890
You can do it.

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:11.650
Fight!

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:13.870
There's no helping those three...

00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:19.280
This is the closest shrine.

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:20.700
Is it here?

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:21.770
No.

00:11:21.770 --> 00:11:23.160
We don't have much time.

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:24.910
Wrong.

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:26.660
Not this one.

00:11:27.110 --> 00:11:28.410
Not here either.

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:30.160
This one's wrong too.

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:31.920
Not here.

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:36.810
This is the last shrine.

00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:38.760
This isn't it either.

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:41.180
Then what should we do?

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:42.930
I guess we'll have to give up.

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:45.580
It might've been one we passed already.

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:47.240
Then let's go back...

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:49.430
Love You Power!

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:53.440
It's fine to "Love You", but what about the Premium Cards?

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:56.940
I can overcome any obstacle with Love You Power!

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:07.030
It was <i>here</i> after all. There's no question about it.

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:11.400
Is the tree over there? Or maybe this way?

00:12:11.400 --> 00:12:13.040
I've forgotten.

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:20.110
It's been fifty whole years.

00:12:20.110 --> 00:12:25.010
It really might be for the best to lock it up in my memories.

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:27.620
I can't allow that!

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:31.730
It's love! No matter how many years pass, love is still love!

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:34.360
That's right! We can't give up here!

00:12:34.360 --> 00:12:35.670
Okay, let's find it!

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:36.480
Yeah!

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:40.500
It's already half past three. What about Makoto-san?

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:42.860
Let's split up and gather information.

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:44.360
Use these if you find it.

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:57.250
That hurt, you know.

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:58.760
I'm sorry!

00:12:58.760 --> 00:13:02.930
You think you can get away with just an apology? I'm in a rush here.

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:07.010
It's already a quarter to four! What would you do if I'm late to my appointment?

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:10.950
I'm in a rush too! It's for Love You!

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:15.310
Do you know if there are any big camphor trees in the area?

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:16.270
Camphor tree?

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:19.580
Go straight that way and it should be on your left.

00:13:20.100 --> 00:13:22.030
I don't have time to deal with this!

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:26.710
My goodness, young folks these days are quite disrespectful.

00:13:27.630 --> 00:13:28.530
I got a text.

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:31.410
Ichigo found it.

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:36.170
It used to be here a long time ago, but it was damaged in a typhoon and had to be cut down.

00:13:41.830 --> 00:13:46.180
Ah, I see. So you've been here all this time.

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:53.680
I can't believe it's been fifty years.

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:57.690
I confessed to that boy under this very tree.

00:13:57.690 --> 00:14:00.190
It took all of my courage.

00:14:05.560 --> 00:14:07.200
But he turned me down.

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:11.160
So your love went away.

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:13.800
It's ancient history.

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:16.990
I met my husband soon after that,

00:14:16.990 --> 00:14:20.760
and we lovingly raised our three children until they went out on their own.

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:27.170
My husband is bedridden now... Before I realized it, I was here searching for my memories.

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:34.720
Thank you for helping me even though you seemed to be so busy.

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:37.730
Here's a token of my appreciation.

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:41.730
When he turned me down he apologized and gave me this.

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:43.230
But it's so important...

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:45.660
It's alright, I want you to have it.

00:14:45.660 --> 00:14:49.740
My memories will continue to live on within my heart.

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:53.740
Plus, I was able to find new love.

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:56.500
Okay.

00:14:56.810 --> 00:14:58.750
Thank you all as well.

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:00.110
I'll be off.

00:15:01.110 --> 00:15:05.840
Goodbye, Ikuyo-san! Love you!

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:06.990
Otome-chan.

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:10.430
Aren't you forgetting something?

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:13.260
My meeting with the top designer!

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:14.330
Let's run!

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:22.010
It's the girl who ran me over carrying that old lady!

00:15:22.010 --> 00:15:25.270
I didn't realize it at the time, but Love You!

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:27.130
What do you mean, "love you"?!

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:32.680
What you really want is the Tropical Basket Coord that I put my soul into, isn't it?

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:33.660
Right.

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:36.530
But you're not getting it.

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:37.700
Why?

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:43.040
Listen, do you realize just how rude it is to make people wait?

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:45.140
You're stealing that person's time.

00:15:45.140 --> 00:15:46.920
You're eating it up.

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:51.730
Makoto-san, please listen. Otome-chan was helping a person in need.

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:53.530
I don't care about your excuses.

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:54.930
Makoto-san!

00:15:56.030 --> 00:15:57.100
It's alright.

00:15:57.100 --> 00:15:59.160
It's my own fault that I was late.

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:00.680
But we've come this far...

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:07.730
It's as Makoto-san said. I'm asking for the 
Tropical Basket Coord that he put his time into.

00:16:08.450 --> 00:16:12.200
I'm just eating the precious time that he put into making that dress.

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:17.200
I understand. Then we'll all go on 
stage without using Premium Cards.

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:21.710
Even though you couldn't get the cards, the four of us grew as a team.

00:16:22.050 --> 00:16:24.040
Let's go for the audition.

00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:26.960
Otome will just have to get over it.

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:31.640
Yes. This pendant I received from Ikuyo-san is enough for me.

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:35.910
Hey, you!

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:39.390
Why do <i>you</i> have my Papa's pendant?

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:42.100
When did you take it?!

00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:46.680
Why?

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:49.110
This is one of Ikuyo-san's memories.

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:53.110
W-Was that old lady from the camphor tree story?

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:02.890
My Papa was confessed to when he was younger.

00:17:02.890 --> 00:17:04.950
She was apparently very beautiful.

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:08.630
However, he had to reject her due to family circumstances.

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:13.550
He told me that he gave this to her as something to remember him by.

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:16.640
Even after fifty years, she...

00:17:22.050 --> 00:17:23.140
Papa.

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:28.000
So she never forgot about their meeting under the camphor tree even after all this time.

00:17:30.010 --> 00:17:33.020
I want for you to have this pendant.

00:17:33.020 --> 00:17:34.650
But she gave that to <i>you.</i>

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:39.560
No, I think that your father would want it to be this way as well.

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:42.660
Love is everything.

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:44.710
Love is power.

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:47.670
Love is eternal!

00:17:48.260 --> 00:17:53.670
Okay. I'll let you have the only Tropical 
Basket Coord in the entire world.

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:04.940
Here.

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:07.320
Love you!

00:18:07.320 --> 00:18:08.450
There's no time.

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:09.870
Special Audition!

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:10.900
Oh yeah!

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:14.090
You'd better hurry up. I'm sure you can do it.

00:18:14.090 --> 00:18:15.440
Love is everything.

00:18:15.810 --> 00:18:17.950
Love is power.

00:21:44.690 --> 00:21:46.780
We got the Mastery of Appearance.

00:21:46.780 --> 00:21:48.240
We did it, Otome-chan.

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:48.780
Aye!

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:50.780
Looks like we all passed.

00:21:50.780 --> 00:21:52.790
Love truly is everything.

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:54.790
Love is power!

00:21:55.480 --> 00:21:59.290
First! Appearance is the ability to harmonize your individuality and compassion.

00:21:59.690 --> 00:22:04.670
Upon gaining full understanding of oneself, one should consider the best way to stand out.

00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:08.300
That's a Mastery that you should understand very well by now.

00:22:08.300 --> 00:22:09.710
Mizuki-san.

00:22:11.670 --> 00:22:14.430
But it won't be easy going from here on out.

00:22:15.670 --> 00:22:17.440
You'll be paired with me.

00:22:17.440 --> 00:22:18.310
Huh?

00:22:20.730 --> 00:22:22.430
What?!

00:23:55.850 --> 00:23:57.870
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.830 --> 00:24:01.890
That Makoto-san sure was strict on time.

00:24:01.890 --> 00:24:03.810
But idols must never be late.

00:24:03.810 --> 00:24:06.380
Let's start by not being late to class.

00:24:06.380 --> 00:24:07.240
Right.

00:24:07.780 --> 00:24:10.010
To idols, time is also life.

00:24:10.940 --> 00:24:13.600
I'm going to stand on stage alongside Mizuki-chan?

00:24:13.600 --> 00:24:14.030
Yeah.

00:24:14.030 --> 00:24:15.640
I'm excited and scared!

00:24:15.640 --> 00:24:17.180
But still, I'm having fun!

00:24:17.180 --> 00:24:18.290
That's my Ichigo!

00:24:18.290 --> 00:24:19.660
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:19.660 --> 00:24:22.090
Heart-pounding! Special Live: Part 1

00:24:22.090 --> 00:24:25.480
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
